","attempts":5,"unaidedCorrect":4},{"skill":"Hears rhymes and keeps the beat of the farm rhyme (moo / coo / doo, cluck / duck)","attempts":1,"unaidedCorrect":1},{"skill":"Makes new lines with the pattern 'The ___ says ___'","attempts":1,"unaidedCorrect":1}],"misconceptions":[{"belief":"Thinks an animal's sound is the same word in every language, so English has no word of its own for it","timesSeen":1,"correctAfterLastSeen":0}]}},"start":{"ms":5045,"topic":{"id":"c1-english-ch05-t01","title":"A Farm","chapter":"A Farm"},"teacher":"Asha","address":"tum"},"boardPages":[{"seq":1,"intentId":"990e97af-8c85-48e9-af8d-74e21bb4960f:tool:128:13695","beat":"explain","skillId":"c1-english-ch05-t01-s1","at":"2026-10-15T01:31:54.099Z","board":"drawing with no shapes; written: \"hen\" \"rooster\""},{"seq":2,"intentId":"990e97af-8c85-48e9-af8d-74e21bb4960f:tool:132:33565","beat":"explain","skillId":"c1-english-ch05-t01-s3","at":"2026-10-15T01:32:13.976Z","board":"drawing with no shapes; written: \"moo\" \"coo\" \"cock-a-doodle-___\""}],"lane2":{"teacher":"agent","agent":{"plan":"Hindi-English sounds ka farq; duck contrast; animal names; nayi line","notes":[],"posed":["c1-english-ch05-t01-i01","c1-english-ch05-t01-i04","c1-english-ch05-t01-i08","c1-english-ch05-t01-i07","c1-english-ch05-t01-i06","c1-english-ch05-t01-i09","c1-english-ch05-t01-i05","c1-english-ch05-t01-i10","c1-english-ch05-t01-i02","c1-english-ch05-t01-i12","c1-english-ch05-t01-i03"],"skill":"c1-english-ch05-t01-s1","turns":[{"who":"child","text":"umm... cow?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, cow moo bolti hai! Farm par hen aur rooster bhi hote hain. Subah cock-a-doodle-doo kaun gaata hai, hen ya rooster?"},{"who":"child","text":"rooster"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, rooster subah cock-a-doodle-doo gaata hai; hen alag hai. Ab Bunty bolta hai, ‘The duck says moo!’ Kya yeh sahi hai? Theek kaise karoge?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... wrong hai... duck says... quack quack?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Bilkul, duck quack quack bolti hai, moo nahi! Ab awaaz ka rhyme suno: baa, maa, moo. Baa ka rhyme maa se hai ya moo se?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... maa?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, baa aur maa ka aakhri sound ek jaisa hai! Ab suno: cow says moo, pigeon says coo, aur rooster sings cock-a-doodle... Aage kya aayega?"},{"who":"child","text":"haan... safe hoon"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Achha, tum safe ho. Shayad mera sawaal sunai nahi diya. Rooster sings cock-a-doodle... aage kya aayega?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... doo?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, doo! Moo, coo, doo ek jaise sound pe khatam hote hain. Ab farm pe ghoda aaya. Nayi line poori karo: The horse says kya?"},{"who":"child","text":"neigh"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, the horse says neigh! Ab do awaazein suno: sheep aur seep. Oon wala farm ka jaanwar kaunsa hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... sheep?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, oon wala jaanwar sheep hai. Ab murga Hindi mein kukdoo-koo bolta hai. English rhyme mein uski awaaz kya hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... kukdoo-koo?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Tumne Hindi wali awaaz boli, kukdoo-koo. English rhyme mein murga cock-a-doodle-doo bolta hai. Jaise duck ki English awaaz alag word hai. Duck kya bolti hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm… quack?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, duck says quack! Ab farm wali rhyme ke do jaanwaron ke English naam batao?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm… cow aur… duck?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, cow aur duck dono farm ke jaanwar hain! Ab ek aur naam bolo. Bakri ko English mein kya kehte hain?"},{"who":"child","text":"goat"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, bakri ko English mein goat kehte hain! Ab goat se ek nayi line banao: The goat says... Kya bologi?"}],"usage":{"usd":0.06043,"tokens":43917},"boards":2,"lastMs":5388,"screen":{"on":"nothing","texts":[],"words":"nothing is on the screen"},"learner":{"c1-english-ch05-t01-s1":{"read":"partly","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-english-ch05-t01-i04","kind":"contrast"},{"g":"c